{{#lsth:Everlasting Ward|Stats}}
{{clr}}
| tips = <div class="tabber-borderless">
{{#tag:tabber|
{{!}}-{{!}} Heat =
<div style="display:none;">'''Heat'''<br></div>
*In a pinch, the bonus Health provided by the Ward can be used as a quick heal, as the Health granted is automatically added to your remaining health and is not reduced from your remaining health when {{A|Elemental Ward}} wears off.
*The Ward is capable of damaging containers and hazards, albeit fairly slowly. Combining {{A|Elemental Ward}} with Spectral Scream and range mods will make for a useful farming tool so long as you have the energy to maintain it.
{{!}}-{{!}} Electricity =
<div style="display:none;">'''Electricity'''<br></div>
*Can be used to great effect on [[Survival]] and [[Exterminate]] missions where enemies approach you from all directions and are often difficult to locate or target. At maximum Ability Strength, the damage reflected can easily finish off weaker enemies and potentially stun any survivors.
{{!}}-{{!}} Toxin =
<div style="display:none;">'''Toxin'''<br></div>
*Works very well with weapons that require you to reload frequently or have long reload times.
*Its damage increase is considered as a Universal damage increase, same as {{A|Vex Armor}} and {{Arcane|Arcane Arachne}}
*Can reduce recharge delay for {{Weapon|Cycron}} or a Kitgun equipped with {{Arcane|Pax Charge}}, however, it does '''not''' affect recharge rate.
*The {{D|Toxin}} proc can by replicated by {{A|Sickening Pulse}} and {{Arcane|Melee Afflictions}}. When the initial {{D|Toxin}} proc expires, any additional {{D|Toxin}} procs created by {{A|Sickening Pulse}} will deal '''1''' {{D|Toxin}} damage per tick.
{{!}}-{{!}} Cold =
<div style="display:none;">'''Cold'''<br></div>
*Properly modded, a {{D|Cold}}-oriented Ward can provide an armor bonus high enough that can counteract the armor penalty generated when casting {{A|Effigy}}.
*The damage reflection is calculated using the damage '''before''' any damage reduction.
}}</div>
<noinclude>
|max = {{WFmax|chroma|chroma2}}
</noinclude>
| bugs = *Allies who enter, leave, then re-enter the radius of {{D|Heat}}-oriented Ward will not regain the buff on the same cast of {{A|Elemental Ward}}. This results in an empty space where the bonus health should have been, even if they took no damage at all.
**This causes {{M|Medi-Ray}} and other healing abilities to attempt to heal the player, but if the player gets out of {{A|Elemental Ward}}'s range, their health will return to normal again, wasting the health restored in the process.
*The in-game UI shows the armor bonus from the {{D|Cold}} aura as a flat bonus rather than a percentage.|
}}
